  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4804.01 Reporting and Auditing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4804.01 Reporting and Auditing.\n\n(a) All reporting and auditing requirements for the automotive oil fees shall be the same as those prescribed in Saf-C 4304.\n\n(b) All reporting and auditing requirements for the motor oil discharge cleanup fees shall be the same as those prescribed in Saf-C 4204, except requests for a waiver of penalties and interest shall be forwarded to the oil fund disbursement board, pursuant to RSA 146-A:11-b, IV.\n\n(c) All forms for these rules shall be the same as those prescribed in Saf-C 4303.04 and Saf-C 4304.01.\n\nSource. #9380, eff 1-30-09 (from Saf-C 4803.01); ss by #10022, eff 11-9-11; ss by #13039, eff 4-20-20\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRule | Statute\n\nSaf-C 4801.01 | RSA 146-D; 147-B:1; RSA 260:38, IV\n\nSaf-C 4802.01-4802.03 | RSA 260:38; RSA 146-A:11-b; RSA 147-B:12; RSA 21-P:6; RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 4802.04 | RSA 294-E:2, V\n\nSaf-C 4802.05 | RSA 294-E:2, VII\n\nSaf-C 4802.06 | RSA 294-E:2, VIII\n\nSaf-C 4802.07 | RSA 146-A:11-b, II; RSA 147-B:12\n\nSaf-C 4802.08 | RSA 260:38; RSA 146-A:11-b; RSA 147-B:12; RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 4802.09 | RSA 147:B:2, I-b\n\nSaf-C 4802.10 | RSA 147-B:2, I-b\n\nSaf-C 4802.11-4802.13 | RSA 260:38; RSA 146-A:11-a & b; RSA 147-B:12; RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 4802.14 | RSA 146-A:11-b, IV\n\nSaf-C 4802.15-4802.16 | RSA 260:28, VI; RSA 146-A:11-b, I(b); RSA 146-A:11-c; RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 4803.01-4803.02 | RSA 146-A:11-b; RSA 147-B:12\n\nSaf-C 4804.01 | RSA 146-A:11-b, IV; RSA 147-B:12; RSA 260:38, IV; RSA 260:44",
